      "context_excerpt": "One of the easiest ways to get started with AI on a PC is with Ollama , an open-source tool that provides a simple interface for running and interacting with LLMs. It supports the ability to drag and drop PDFs into prompts, conversational chat and multimodal understanding workflows that include text and images.",
